--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">How can I pay for my order?
 </h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-c1rjjm6egtk"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">You can pay for your order in several ways. You can pay online via an internet payment system or pay cash on delivery when you pick up the goods.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-fscsn7kafam" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-fscsn7kafam" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-fscsn7kafam"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Can I pay upon pickup?
 </h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-90x36irziif"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Yes, when placing your order, you have the option to choose cash on delivery. In that case, you will pay for the order upon pickup.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-e8xfzvacc8s" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-e8xfzvacc8s" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-e8xfzvacc8s"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">My payment failed; what are my options?
 </h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-lynedklpj1"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">If the online payment is not successful, the order is not paid for, and in that case, you will need to place a new order</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-qh7xkxrq04h" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-qh7xkxrq04h" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-qh7xkxrq04h"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><div class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">What are the shipping costs?</div></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-k29hyhxdiwp"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Shipping costs depend on the selected delivery method and delivery location. You can find the exact shipping cost on our website in the “Important Information” section, or it will be displayed directly in your shopping cart when you complete your order&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-vgc8yi0crfl" class="core__group--item tab__item" data-id="ecom-vgc8yi0crfl" style=""><div class="core__group--body tabs__body"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-xjhk248xwf"><div class="ecom-core ecom-group core__block ecom-sts0iv2a3le"> <div class="core__group--wrapper ecom-accordion__wrapper ecom-flex ecom-column ecom-w__full ecom__element ecom__accordion" data-r="" style=""><div class="core__group--items"><div id="ecom-30lrw5rtrba" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item ecom-item-active ecom-item-group-init" data-id="ecom-30lrw5rtrba" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items ecom-item-active" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-30lrw5rtrba"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">ORDER CHANGES AND CANCELLATIONS</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-8vinos0i9mh"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Unfortunately, once an order has been submitted, it is no longer possible to change its contents or add or remove individual items. We therefore recommend that you carefully review your shopping cart before confirming your order to avoid any complications during order processing.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-727kyyjfx15" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-727kyyjfx15" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-727kyyjfx15"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Can I combine multiple orders into one?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-8asghrotou"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Unfortunately, it is not possible to combine multiple orders into one. Each order is processed and shipped separately, partly because shipments are dispatched from multiple warehouses.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-9r6h6pumr5d" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-9r6h6pumr5d" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-9r6h6pumr5d"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Can I split my order into several packages with diferent shipping addresses?
 </h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-vhn97l122ds"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Again, this depends on the course. Many online courses include assessments and assignments to help reinforce the learning and gauge your understanding of the material. These can be in the form of quizzes, projects, or practical exercises. Course descriptions often mention the presence of assessments, and some courses provide certificates upon successful completion of the assignments.
</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-6czr7ajd8l4" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-6czr7ajd8l4" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-6czr7ajd8l4"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">How can I cancel my order?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-zy6mfa72b0q"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">An order can only be canceled if it has not yet entered the processing stage. If you decide to cancel your order, please notify us via email as soon as possible.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-si8to4swwb9" class="core__group--item tab__item" data-id="ecom-si8to4swwb9" style=""><div class="core__group--body tabs__body"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-8nosiibjuwp"><div class="ecom-core ecom-group core__block ecom-bo7iw3uuk9v"> <div class="core__group--wrapper ecom-accordion__wrapper ecom-flex ecom-column ecom-w__full ecom__element ecom__accordion" data-r="" style=""><div class="core__group--items"><div id="ecom-u8dz4k91mc" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item ecom-item-active ecom-item-group-init" data-id="ecom-u8dz4k91mc" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items ecom-item-active" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-u8dz4k91mc"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Do you have a physical store or place where I can try the goods?
 </h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-bfhuhfp6piv"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Unfortunately, this option is not available. We operate exclusively as an online store, so we do not have a showroom or retail location where you can try on or pick up products in person.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-i2db7iqbcch" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-i2db7iqbcch" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-i2db7iqbcch"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Which stores carry your brand?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-3r2xyeui4n5"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Unfortunately, we do not currently have updated information on which stores currently carry our brand.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-3adsrawpydo" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-3adsrawpydo" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-3adsrawpydo"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">If an item is out of stock, how can I find out if and when it will be available?
 </h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-v8pitur43u"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">If a particular size is not available on our website, in most cases we do not restock the products, as we update our collections annually. However, it may happen that some items are returned by customers and subsequently restocked on an ongoing basis. Availability can therefore only be checked periodically directly on our website. Unfortunately, we do not currently offer the option to track availability or receive email notifications when a product is restocked.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-j87v8z47ouf" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-j87v8z47ouf" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-j87v8z47ouf"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Can you check the availability of a specific item at a partner store?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-noy1co5z7mr"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Our warehouse is not connected to the systems of partner stores, so we cannot check the availability of items at individual stores. For this reason, we also do not have information about the stock levels of a specific product at specific retail locations.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-1tkwlhbpqjk" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-1tkwlhbpqjk" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-1tkwlhbpqjk"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><div class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Can I try out the products and pick them up at your business address?
 </div></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-8sek0fwsje7"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Unfortunately, this option is not available. We operate exclusively as an online store.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-okecabnm0ba" class="core__group--item tab__item" data-id="ecom-okecabnm0ba" style=""><div class="core__group--body tabs__body"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-izp39l8xuup"><div class="ecom-core ecom-group core__block ecom-jtjaed87n8c"> <div class="core__group--wrapper ecom-accordion__wrapper ecom-flex ecom-column ecom-w__full ecom__element ecom__accordion" data-r="" style=""><div class="core__group--items"><div id="ecom-eimjrqfa2r9" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item ecom-item-active ecom-item-group-init" data-id="ecom-eimjrqfa2r9" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items ecom-item-active" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-eimjrqfa2r9"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">What is the warranty period for the products?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-jj9x6nu077e"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">The warranty period for all products is 24 months from the date of purchase. You can find more detailed information on our website in the “How to Return, Exchange, or File a Complaint” section.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-j4nkjmc1bj" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-j4nkjmc1bj" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-j4nkjmc1bj"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">How can I return an order?
</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-5adalj2kbv"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Goods can be returned within 14 days of delivery. To process a return, you must fill out the form included with the shipment (or available on our website), enclose it with the goods in the package, and then send the package to the address provided.<div><br></div><div>Detailed information on how to proceed with a return is available on our website in the “How to Return, Exchange, or File a Complaint” section.<span style="white-space:pre">	</span></div><div><br></div><div>Detailed information on how to proceed with a return is available on our website in the “How to Return, Exchange, or File a Complaint” section.</div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-86ho170k6wl" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-86ho170k6wl" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-86ho170k6wl"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">
 When and how will I receive my refund?
 </h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-7zds5dcqewf"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Once we receive the returned goods, we will refund the purchase price within 14 days. If you paid by card through a payment gateway, the refund will be credited to the account associated with that card. However, if you paid via cash on delivery, we will refund the money via bank transfer. Therefore, in this case, you must provide your account number on the form.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-z7mergszpf8" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-z7mergszpf8" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-z7mergszpf8"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">
 Where can I find the claim form?
 </h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body ecom-accordion__item--flex"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-4s7wxb4rok5"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-01619rxe6f4c" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">The claim form is available on our website in the “How to Return, Exchange, or File a Claim for Goods” section&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-1vkjpfnowkl" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-1vkjpfnowkl" style=""><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined" data-target-id="#ecom-1vkjpfnowkl"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><div class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">
 How long does it take to process a refund?
